WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Modulators move knobs for you: LFOs, envelopes, steps and macros.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.600
Right-click any knob, here the synth's Cutoff, and choose Modulate with.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.400
Pick New LFO. The LFO is made and set on the knob in one go.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:25.000
Press Play. The ring around the knob shows the LFO moving it.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:30.600
Tools, Modulators lists them all: shape, rate and depth.
